message: "If you use this DTTS package, cite the repository archive and preserve the medical non-claim boundary. Repository archives are release artifacts, not standalone peer-reviewed article identifiers."
type: software
title: "DTTS v0.3.1: Integrated Model and Audit Synthesis for Sleep-Like Recovery-Transition Toy Networks"
authors:
